Some tools translate observed compression/container behavior and retain short
instruction signatures, offsets, resource identifiers and protocol constants for
verification. The research notes describe those observations and their limits;
this work is not presented as a clean-room recovery or a proof of game parity.

Ghidra, resource_dasm/m68kdasm, hfsutils, Java, emulators, SDL, and other external
tools remain separate projects under their own licenses. Install them from their
upstream sources; their binaries and upstream artwork are not bundled here.

provenance.json records the local source origins of the initial tool/documentation
snapshots. Text-only evidence notes retain historical results but omit original
captures, raw dumps, project databases and generated output. A successful clone
or synthetic check does not independently reproduce those historical results.
